  "source_reference": "TO-4 sections1.1/1.2 sheet3, pinned by docs/besm6-hardware-time.md",
  "approximations": [
    "FIFO per bank is a selected logical priority, not a claimed electrical arbitration.",
    "Write visibility is explicitly configured within the common bank cycle.",
    "Read sampling at cycle start or at data return is explicitly configured."
  ],
  "boundaries": [
    "The port shares physical storage and the hardware calendar; CPU reset preserves it.",
    "Raw 50-bit control is interpreted by a receiver, not by this physical port.",
    "Cancellation suppresses an unfinished transfer but never shortens a started bank cycle.",
    "Buffer ownership, address-mapping leases, CPU fetch/operand routing and DMA are not yet connected.",
    "Expanded SIMH bank timing is unspecified and rejected."
  ]
